1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Find a place, explore what it offers, and take your next step.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Open Aura, then Spaces. Search by name, location or what you need.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Open a Space to see its introduction, location, offerings and activity.

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Browse an offering, review the details and price, then prepare a request.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Ask about availability or explain what you need. Requests stay as local drafts in this preview.

6
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Open Your Spaces & management. Add your photo, identity and location, then save your draft.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,500
From your Space Wall, choose Preview as a customer. Review the experience before enabling your local listing.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Your next place is in Aura. Open Spaces and find a possibility worth following.
